Game content
------------

Arcainist is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by
or sponsored by Arcane Tinmen, Tenacious Games or any other owner of The Spoils.

"The Spoils" and the names, rules text, flavor text and numbers of its cards are
the property of their respective owners. They appear in this repository (the
card files in cards/ and the card names in decks/ and docs/) only so the game
can be played, for free and non-commercially, and are not covered by the AGPL.
Forks that redistribute them do so under the same terms.

No card art, rulebooks or other official material is distributed. Players who
want card images load their own copies into their browser; they are never
uploaded to the server.

If you hold rights to The Spoils and want any of this content removed, please
open an issue on the project's repository and it will be taken down.
